# Vedantu

> Vedantu is an Indian online learning platform (LIVE interactive classes, recorded courses, and free study resources) for school students from Class 1 to 12 and competitive-exam aspirants. It covers CBSE, ICSE, IGCSE and major State Boards, and prep for JEE, NEET, CUET and Olympiads, alongside a large free library of NCERT solutions, textbook solutions, revision notes, sample papers, previous-year papers, syllabi, formulas and study material.

This file lists the main, machine-readable sections of vedantu.com to help agents and LLMs locate authoritative content. Free study resources (solutions, notes, papers) are organized by class, board, and subject. Paid offerings are LIVE online tuition, courses, and one-to-one classes. Content spans Classes 1-12 plus entrance-exam preparation.

